{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55577","headline":"偈 · 神禄","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧然独处意沉吟，谁信无弦发妙音。\n终日法堂惟静坐，更无人问本来心。\n（见《五灯会元》卷八、《全闽诗话》卷十二引《闽书》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"神禄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}